From: Smart AP firmware project
Subject: [PATCH] bwl: keep inherited netlink transaction overload visible

GCC 14 diagnoses the inherited send_receive_msg() overload as hidden by
the NL80211-specific overload. Import the base overload into the derived
class scope instead of suppressing overloaded-virtual diagnostics.

--- a/common/beerocks/bwl/shared/nl80211_socket.h
+++ b/common/beerocks/bwl/shared/nl80211_socket.h
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@
 class nl80211_socket : public nl_genl_socket {
 
 public:
+    using nl_genl_socket::send_receive_msg;
+
     /**
      * @brief Class destructor.
      */
